      "why": "argument-validation leniency differs by provider language; pinned so a change to either is deliberate WHEN logos-protocol feat/canonical-codec is pinned this expectation CHANGES: the Rust provider becomes strict and answers dispatch_failed, because the host stops coercing the value before the module's LIDL-type validation sees it. Measured, not predicted. Update the expectation when the re-pin lands."
